# The canonical origin. Drives metadataBase, canonical tags, Open Graph image
# URLs, the sitemap, robots.txt and JSON-LD.
#
# Absolute URLs are required for share cards: a relative /opengraph-image does
# not resolve for the machine fetching it when Slack, iMessage or X unfurls a
# link, and the card renders blank.
#
# No trailing slash. src/lib/site-url.ts joins paths onto this with `new URL()`,
# and a trailing slash there produces doubled separators in the sitemap.
#
# Unset, this falls back to the production domain in src/lib/site-url.ts, so a
# build that forgets it is still correct. Set it explicitly for preview
# deployments, where the fallback would point previews at production.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://kyrstinkauchak.com
